.project-title Augmented Reality Theater
.role
    span.bold Role:
    | ideation, team lead, research, AR software development

img(src="imgs/cover.jpg")

.blurb
    | This project explored possibilities for Augmented Reality in Theater.
    | In collaboration with a workshop-style theater class, the AR Theater team developed a couple prototypes
    | that demonstrate how AR can expand the experience of attending a theater performance.
    | There were three prototypes: The Program, the Prayer Wheel, and the Tarot Cards.

.role.bold The Program
.blurb
    | With the help of Artivive (startup from skydeck) we designed a program that is filled with hidden scenes and director and actor interviews.
    | Amazing
    a.sub-link(href="https://molecule.github.io/", target="_blank") Molly
    | led this portion of the project an filmed and edited all of the actors for the AR Scenes.
    br
    br
    | For the AR experience audience members could download the Artivive app and point their mobile device at the play’s
    | program and enacted scenes or interviews play overlayed on the program.

