.role.bold Prayer Wheel
.blurb
    | This experiment was a laser cut spinning wheel that mimics the tibetan prayer wheel (prominent theme in the play).
    br
    br
    | For the AR experience audience would spin the wheel, scan a question and leave an audio message answering it.
    | Audio messages become little fires in AR that other people can click on and listen to.

.col-2.grid(data-colcade="columns: .grid-col, items: .grid-item")
